Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.63,0:23:40.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我们能证明是他们的全责  你还可以考虑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So if we can prove full liability, you could also consider
