Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.37,0:24:33.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是通过收集包括你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but by collecting a range of
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.63,0:24:37.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和其他目击者在内的一系列记忆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}recollections from yourself and any witnesses,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.10,0:24:39.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就能为构建完整案件经过提供帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we can help build a corroborative picture of the whole.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.36,0:24:41.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我什么都不记得  一片空白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't remember anything. It's a total blank.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.47,0:24:43.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我或许能提供点帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I've got something that might help.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.86,0:24:46.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么  喝醉酒就行吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, getting drunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.83,0:24:48.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事故发生地离城堡港酿酒厂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The accident happened a few hundred meters
