Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.15,0:25:08.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  现在把这味道记在心里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK. Now, hold that smell in your mind,
