Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.79,0:25:21.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有结果了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Getting something now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.18,0:25:26.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去了一家漫画店之类的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. I went to a sort of comic shop...
