Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.05,0:25:51.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有个穿黄衣服的女的朝我走来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was a woman in a yellow coat coming towards me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.98,0:25:55.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她的脸记得很清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good recall on her face.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.82,0:25:59.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她涂的口红特别怪  特别扎眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She had this weird lipstick on. It stood out.
