Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.03,0:26:30.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.25,0:26:34.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我发现了下一个目标  黄衣女郎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I've got someone to look for, Little Miss Yellow Coat.
