Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.95,0:26:53.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是啊  - 你知道怎么修这个吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - You don't know how to fix this, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.85,0:26:57.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道  我待会儿看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um, yeah, I'll have a look at it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.93,0:26:59.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好啊  妈妈  - 好啊  你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi, Mom. - Hi, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.70,0:27:03.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚就要上台了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tonight's the big night.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.86,0:27:10.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- ∮ 我们想做什么就能做什么 ∮ - 老爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ∮ We coulda been anything that we wanted to be... ∮ - Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.64,0:27:12.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们学校的音乐剧  《龙蛇小霸王》\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}School musical, Bugsy Malone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.31,0:27:16.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.31,0:27:19.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.87,0:27:22.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们弄了一套音响系统来放配乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've got this, um, sound system for the backing tracks
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.24,0:27:25.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他们不会用  我就说我帮他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that they can't work out and I said I'd help them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.55,0:27:27.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我得在学校待一整天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So... I'm gonna be there all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.52,0:27:30.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不会孤单死吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna die of loneliness here, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.40,0:27:31.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.37,0:27:35.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚点见  7:30\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we'll see you later, 7:30.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.96,0:27:36.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别忘了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.00,0:27:37.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.30,0:27:41.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 回头见  - 再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- See ya. - See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.95,0:27:42.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.18,0:29:13.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天才发生的事  你真高效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was only yesterday. You're efficient.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.39,0:29:15.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事件越近  记忆就越清晰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fresher the memory, the stronger it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.56,0:29:18.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,越清晰  就越有利于案子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the stronger the memory, the stronger the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.71,0:29:23.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你来闻一下这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll also just get you to take a sniff of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.87,0:29:29.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别人看到会怎么想啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God knows what they think we're doing in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.32,0:29:36.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭上眼睛  我会放段音乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you close your eyes, I'm also gonna play a piece of music.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.50,0:29:40.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  当时确实在放这首歌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God, yeah, yeah, that, that was on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.13,0:29:43.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真奇怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.39,0:29:46.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记住这些东西  想象一下你看到的画面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold those things in your mind and picture what you saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.96,0:29:57.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我当时在斯坦霍普路  宾馆附近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was on Stanhope Road, near the hotel place,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.10,0:29:59.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,浏览橱窗里的东西  随便看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}looking at flats and stuff, you know, window shopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.52,0:30:02.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看到一个男的迎面走来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw this guy walking towards me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.55,0:30:05.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我记得当时还在想他长得挺不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remember thinking he looked sort of sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.01,0:30:11.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,音乐是停在路边的一辆车里放的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The music was coming from the car, which pulled off.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.00,0:30:15.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个时候送餐车刚好经过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually that was when the delivery thing drove past.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.20,0:30:19.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,栅栏披萨  车速多少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fences Pizza? What sort of speed was it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.25,0:30:21.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是问它超速了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean, was it going too fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.56,0:30:26.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 重点放在那辆车上  - 也许吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Try and focus on the vehicle. - Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.13,0:30:34.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道  我不确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. I couldn't really say.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.30,0:30:37.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,撞击厉害吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about the impact itself?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.26,0:30:40.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,撞上的那一刻我没看到  之后我才看到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I didn't really see it. I just saw the aftermath, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.10,0:30:51.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这之前你还看到了一道亮光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A moment earlier you saw a bright light?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.27,0:30:54.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  就像相机的闪光灯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Like a camera flash just before.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.83,0:30:56.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在牙医诊所外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just outside the dentist place.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.44,0:32:03.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里都是隔音窗吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm assuming your window glazing's soundproof.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.27,0:32:04.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  偶尔有人会尖叫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, we get the odd screamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.87,0:32:06.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我就不给你放音乐了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't bother with the music then.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.60,0:32:09.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记忆画面会有点尴尬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, to be honest, the memory's a bit embarrassing...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.61,0:32:11.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别担心  我什么都见识过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry, I've seen it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.08,0:32:13.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必须得用那玩意吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have to use that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.92,0:32:18.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的记忆是绝对保密不会公开的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, your memories will be sealed and private.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.04,0:32:20.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除非画面显示你伤害了自己或他人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless they indicate you're harming yourself or another person.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.33,0:32:23.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on then.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.16,0:32:41.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我当时有个病人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd had a patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.53,0:32:43.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.38,0:32:47.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她应该是6点左右离开的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She left around six, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.79,0:32:49.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我留下来整理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I stayed to clear up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.44,0:32:52.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在窗外看到什么了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You saw something from the window?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.65,0:32:56.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宾馆窗户里有个男的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was a guy in the hotel window.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.59,0:32:59.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么说呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, what can I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.52,0:33:02.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,秀色可餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was picturesque.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.20,0:33:05.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你拍照了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you take a photo?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.59,0:33:08.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想拍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I tried to.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.60,0:33:12.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但忘记关闪光灯了  所以什么也没拍到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I left the flash on by mistake, so all I got was the reflection.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.89,0:33:16.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 然后呢  - 我本想再拍一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And then? - I was going to take another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.20,0:33:20.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看到有个女人直直盯着下面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw some woman staring at something.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.16,0:33:24.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我往下看  底下一阵骚动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I looked down, it was just a load of commotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.86,0:33:29.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有个穿青绿色外套的女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was a woman in a sort of lime coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.16,0:33:31.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实是黄色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yellow actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.62,0:33:34.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 反正是很艳的颜色  - 记忆会有点主观\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, I knew it was vivid. - Well, memories can be subjective.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.85,0:33:36.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们基于群众看到的碎片画面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What we do is build up an overall average,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.85,0:33:40.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,综合建立起完整的场景\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a crowd-sourced picture of reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.18,0:33:44.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看到那辆车撞上行人了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you see the vehicle that hit the pedestrian?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.44,0:33:45.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对车速有估计吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any sense of its speed?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.91,0:33:49.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,车祸发生时我并没有看见  抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't see the actual crash, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.08,0:33:57.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.34,0:34:03.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那照片你不会说出去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't tell anyone about the photo?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.03,0:34:06.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不非得写进报告里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't need to put that in my report.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.56,0:34:08.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会保密的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's safe with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.28,0:34:20.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那应该是304房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That'd be room 304.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.46,0:34:22.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能告诉我住客是谁吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you tell me who stayed there?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.35,0:34:24.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你不是警察吗  - 不是  不过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're not the police? - No, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.03,0:34:27.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你必须申请索要这些信息了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you'd have to lodge for an information request for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.31,0:34:29.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是流程可能得要一周啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that could take up to a week to process.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.38,0:34:30.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  上头对这事要求很严\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, management's an ass about it
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.50,0:34:33.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自从那个谁出了事  艳照法官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ever since that thing with what's-his-name, the judge of Hot Shots?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.81,0:34:35.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之他被人发现找了男妓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway, he got caught with a rent boy and,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.74,0:34:39.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一家小报黑进我们的登记系统搞到了他的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a tabloid got his name by hacking our booking system,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.14,0:34:41.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们现在对这个管得很严\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and yeah, they're tight as anything about the rule now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.41,0:34:43.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想找的这个女人倒也没做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, the woman I'm after hasn't done anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.85,0:34:46.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是觉得她可能看到了外面发生的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just think she might have seen something outside
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.12,0:34:47.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在昨晚6:30左右\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}yesterday evening about 6:30.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.97,0:34:49.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I can...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.19,0:34:52.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能告诉你她并不在户外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can tell you that she wasn't outside...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.67,0:34:55.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且我也知道她在看什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I know what she was looking at.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.36,0:34:56.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How so?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.78,0:34:58.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能透露具体的身份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't tell you who she is but,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.21,0:35:02.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过她喜欢有趣的电影\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}um, she's into interesting films.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.88,0:35:05.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们记录了住客在客房内看的电影  而且\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We log the inhouse movies that people watch and, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.76,0:35:08.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她选的片子非常显眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}her choice stood out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.43,0:35:15.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她可真会享受  多谢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How nice for her. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.50,0:35:25.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, bless you.
