Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.08,0:55:56.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经到现场了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I'm at the scene now.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.94,0:55:59.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁会连婴儿都杀呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who kills a baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.15,0:56:05.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.87,0:56:08.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许凶手是害怕留下目击证人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Probably someone worried about leaving a witness.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.78,0:56:12.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,楼上是血浴  楼下又杀婴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bloodbath upstairs and this downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.08,0:56:14.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是他看不见啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he couldn't see.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.37,0:56:19.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这小可怜是先天失明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Poor fucker was born blind apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.48,0:56:23.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我得说我完全不知道凶手是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I have to say, I have absolutely no idea who I'm looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.14,0:56:27.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以还好他们不会问我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So it's a good job they're not asking me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.07,0:56:34.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧  咱们走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's clear out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.20,0:56:36.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让回忆小队接手吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's let the recall team do their job.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.71,0:56:38.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.45,0:56:41.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.19,0:56:52.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,*付出一点爱  你就会有回报*\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}*You give a little love and it all comes back to you*
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.68,0:56:58.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,*大家都会记住你*\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}*You know You're gonna be remembered*
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.23,0:57:01.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,*记住你说的话  做的事*\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}*For the things that you say and do*
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.49,0:57:04.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唱得好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well done!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.79,0:57:08.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请大家为我们的校合唱队鼓掌吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put your hands together for this year's fantastic school choir.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.34,0:57:11.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚真是太精彩了  多谢各位前来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a lovely evening. Thank you so much for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.99,0:57:20.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请大家为亨利老师鼓掌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put your hands together for Mrs. Henry...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.11,0:57:23.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bravo!
